      "prose": "Earendale is a small floating town of 57 permanent residents, located on a chunk of land that broke off from the ear of the Great Head and accessible only by air transport. The town is known for the Wordlark Hollow Resort and Spa just outside its borders, where hot springs attract hundreds of seasonal visitors. People come from across the Great Head hoping wordlarks will visit them at the springs to help resolve matters of the heart.",
